# CR campaign county reference tables: builder-generated binaries (16 files, ~9 MB gz).
# Regenerate with tests/tools/build_county_*.py (needs /mnt/h ResStock/ComStock parquets).
# They stay in solver/upload/reference_data/ because _load_ref and the docker image
# COPY read from there; only git tracking is excluded.
solver/upload/reference_data/*.json.gz
